                                     Dear Mr. Kerrisk,

working on the update of the German translation of utf-8.7 I found an
inconsistent markup for UCS, Unicode, ASCII. As it was bold in many
cases, I made an "all-bold" version based on version 3.32.

Kind regards
    Martin Schauer

