 .B ASCII
 and
 .BR UTF-8 .
@@ -85,7 +92,8 @@
 All
 .B UCS
 characters greater than 0x7f are encoded as a multibyte sequence
-consisting only of bytes in the range 0x80 to 0xfd, so no ASCII
